    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Your ultimate goal is to craft the <strong>omega</strong> element. <br></li><li> You start with the  <strong>generate </strong> command, which creates an <strong>alpha</strong> element. <br></li><li> You unlock new features from <strong>shop</strong> with <strong>buy</strong> command.<br></li><li> You can create new elements from the existing ones using <strong>pack</strong> and <strong>merge</strong> commands.<br></li><li> Crafting recipes are hidden by default. When the elements of the recipes have been present in the storage, they become visible.<br></li><li> You can create custom commands to automate your game. For example '<strong>g = generate generage</strong>' creates command <strong>g</strong>, which executes <strong>generate</strong>-command twice. <br></li><li> Crafting trees are procedurally generated.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Scoring </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong> Command Typing Speed </strong> - Faster typing speed yields a better score.<br></li><li> <strong> Command Efficiency </strong> - A smaller command count yields a better score. <br></li><li> <strong> Storage Efficiency </strong> -  A smaller storage value yields a better score. </li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Your ultimate goal is to craft the <strong>omega</strong> element. <br></li><li> You start with the  <strong>generate </strong> command, which creates an <strong>alpha</strong> element. <br></li><li> You unlock new features from <strong>shop</strong> with <strong>buy</strong> command.<br></li><li> You can create new elements from the existing ones using <strong>pack</strong> and <strong>merge</strong> commands.<br></li><li> Crafting recipes are hidden by default. When the elements of the recipes have been present in the storage, they become visible.<br></li><li> You can create custom commands to automate your game. For example '<strong>g = generate generage</strong>' creates command <strong>g</strong>, which executes <strong>generate</strong>-command twice. <br></li><li> Crafting trees are procedurally generated.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Scoring </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong> Command Typing Speed </strong> - Faster typing speed yields a better score.<br></li><li> <strong> Command Efficiency </strong> - A smaller command count yields a better score. <br></li><li> <strong> Storage Efficiency </strong> -  A smaller storage value yields a better score. </li></ul>",
